\"><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"fill text-wrapper\" style=\"white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word;margin:-0.8995465299684542% 0;font-family:&quot;Roboto&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:0.404531em;line-height:1.4;text-align:left;padding:1.2618296529968454% 2.5236593059936907%;color:#000000\"><span><span style=\"color: #fff\">Explore mais sobre o <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; color: #fff\">Wat Ratchaburana<\/span><span style=\"color: #fff\"> com a Mundo Asia Tours!<\/span><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><\/amp-story-grid-layer><\/amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"44375129-089c-4716-9500-368d1d841778\" auto-advance-after=\"7s\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"vertical\" aspect-ratio=\"412:618\" class=\"grid-layer\"><\/p>\n<div class=\"page-fullbleed-area\" style=\"background-color:#8c9ea8\">\n<div class=\"page-safe-area\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;pointer-events:none;left:0;top:-9.25926%;width:100%;height:118.51852%;opacity:1\">\n<div style=\"pointer-events:initial;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;z-index:0\" class=\"mask\" id=\"el-07848b1a-3503-49c7-9ea0-145119aefe45\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;width:237.03704%;height:100%;left:-68.51852%;top:0%\" data-leaf-element=\"true\"><amp-img layout=\"fill\" src=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/descubra-a-historia-de-wat-ratchaburana.jpg\" alt=\"Descubra a hist\u00f3ria de Wat Ratchaburana\" srcSet=\"https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/descubra-a-historia-de-wat-ratchaburana.jpg 800w,https:\/\/www.mundoasiatours.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/descubra-a-historia-de-wat-ratchaburana-150x113.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 107vh, 238vw\" disable-inline-width=\"true\"><\/amp-img><\/div>\n<div class=\"element-overlay-area\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(0.5turn, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.33) 100%)\"><\/div>\n